{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hMVJWb1LlX1794483386.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>【玫瑰戰爭】第四集精華 女演員爭風呷醋大打出手</p><p></p><p>子盈(陳自瑤)即使醜聞纏身，仍獲老闆雲生(陳豪)包容，惹來鳳儀(姚子羚)妒忌！鳳儀搵來林安安(鄺潔楹)向子盈落迷藥，將子盈送上酒店貴賓房。</p><p>菲雅在過去已情傾德龍，當年得知德龍與子盈在一起時，竟藉拍戲公報私仇。未幾，子盈便陷入醜聞風波！</p><p></p><p>玫瑰戰爭｜星期一至五 晚上 8:30｜翡翠台</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T14:23:59.011455+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:37:58.033029+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T14:17:20.811538+00:00","content_hash":"cfc050962f4ad23313c39bb76cf0db970ce3f4579d8958ac1a22dc061f9bcff8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T14:23:59.011455+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}